<title>USA: PC Service sees Q1 EPS of $0.06-0.10.</title>
<headline>PC Service sees Q1 EPS of $0.06-0.10.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>PC Service Source Inc Thursday said it expects first-quarter revenues to rise to the range of $31.5 million to $33.5 million and share earnings within the range of $0.06 to $0.10 per share.</p>
<p>The company earlier reported fourth-quarter earnings of $279,000 or $0.05 per share. Fourth-quarter revenues increased 41 percent to $28.6 million, compared with $20.3 million a year ago.</p>
</text>
